# Context allowlist for the BASE layer Dockerfile (BuildKit reads the
# `<Dockerfile-name>.dockerignore` beside the Dockerfile). The build
# context is the REPO ROOT, but the base image only COPYs the
# livespec-step-timer wrapper — allowlisting just that file keeps the
# context transfer tiny and the build hermetic.
*
!livespec_dev_tooling/otel_step_timer.py
